@host = http://localhost:5069
@eventId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@pricingTierId = 11111111-AAAA-AAAA-AAAA-111111111111

### Get all events
GET {{host}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

###

### Get event by ID
GET {{host}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create event
POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sydney Music Festival",
  "description": "Live music event",
  "venue": "Sydney Olympic Park",
  "dateTime": "2026-12-20T19:00:00",
  "totalCapacity": 1000
}

###

### Purchase tickets
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pricingTierId": "YOUR-PRICING-TIER-ID",
  "quantity": 2,
  "customerName": "John Smith"
}

###